            "content": "import boto3\n\ndef encrypt_payload(plaintext, key_id):\n    kms_client = boto3.client('kms')\n    response = kms_client.encrypt(\n        KeyId=key_id,\n        Plaintext=plaintext\n    )\n    return response['CiphertextBlob']\n",
